# CI Milestones

When the user asks to commit, open a PR, push, or release/promote, run the matching CI skill (each reviews before the git action and respects consent):

| Intent | Skill |
|---|---|
| Commit | `skills/code/ci/commit/SKILL.md` |
| Open / create a PR | `skills/code/ci/pr/SKILL.md` |
| Push | `skills/code/ci/push/SKILL.md` |
| Release / promote / publish | `skills/code/ci/release/SKILL.md` |
| Fix-until-clean self-review | `skills/code/ci/local-review-loop/SKILL.md` |
| Autonomous PR review-fix loop | `skills/code/ci/pr-review-loop/SKILL.md` |

See `rules/behaviors/code-review-gate.mdc` for the gate and `behaviors/git-*-consent.mdc` for consent rules.
